title: Denial Intelligence › Peer-to-peer › Record the call outcome
route: /denials/D-3318/brief
intro: After the call, the person logs how it went. 'Overturned' and 'Partly restored' close the denial; 'Upheld' starts a written appeal from the call notes.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the call itself is not simulated. The clinician holds it outside the app and logs the result here.
---
start s1 "Click 'Record the call outcome' on the brief page"
ext x1 "Clinician holds the peer-to-peer call with the payer's reviewer"
overlay o1 "Modal 'Record the call outcome'\nD-3318 · Cardinal Health Plan"
input i1 "Pick one (radio cards)\n'Overturned' (chosen at first), 'Partly restored' or 'Upheld'"
process p1 "Card texts\nOverturned: the payer restored the requested days, the denial closes\nPartly restored: closes with a new end date\nUpheld: Advocate starts a written appeal from your call notes"
input i2 "Note (optional)\n'Who you spoke to and what was agreed.'"
click c1 "Click 'Log the outcome'"
click c2 "Click 'Cancel', the X, press Esc, or click the dimmed area"
endx e1 "Nothing is logged"

store st0 "Outcome saved on the denial: kind, note, time\nThe scheduled 'Peer-to-peer call' line leaves the History\nHistory: 'You logged the call outcome: ...' with the note"
decision d1 "Which outcome?"

store st1 "Request settled: leaves 'Appeal or call' (Dashboard stage 'Decided')\nChip 'Overturned' or 'Partly restored'\nLedger result approved or partly approved"
ext x2 "Payer restores the requested days, or part of them, on the call"
agent a1 "Cadence updates the ledger and books the next review"
toast t1 "'Overturned' or 'Partly restored'\n'The ledger is updated and the next review is booked.'"
process p2 "Sidebar badge goes down by one\nThe denial moves to 'Closed' in the open denials list\nNext-step block 'Overturned on the call' or 'Partly restored on the call'"

store st2 "Chip 'Appeal drafting'\nClock becomes 'to file': 60 days from the denial date"
agent a2 "Advocate starts a written appeal from the call notes"
toast t2 "'Outcome logged: upheld'\n'Advocate started the written appeal. Open it from the denial.'"
process p3 "Denial page shows 'Advocate is drafting the appeal' with 'Open the draft'"

toast t3 "Brief page banner 'Outcome logged: overturned, partly restored or upheld' with 'Back to the denial'"
toast t4 "Notification 'Call outcome: ...' from Advocate\nOpens the request on the Dashboard"
click c3 "Click 'Back to the denial'"
process p4 "The button 'Record the call outcome' stays on the brief\nLogging again runs these steps again (demo does not stop it)"

goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › Confirm and draft"
goto g3 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"
end e2 "Denial is closed with the call result"
end e3 "Written appeal is under way"

s1 --> x1 --> o1
o1 --> i1 --> p1
o1 --> i2
p1 --> c1
i2 --> c1
o1 --> c2 --> e1
c1 --> st0 --> d1
d1 -->|Overturned or Partly restored| x2 --> st1 --> a1 --> t1 --> p2 --> e2
d1 -->|Upheld| st2 --> a2 --> t2 --> p3 --> e3
st0 --> t3 --> c3 --> g1
st0 --> t4 --> g3
e3 --> g2
e2 --> g1
t3 --> p4
